            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Tree Tether"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A creature hit by the timberweb's vine Strike becomes entangled by the sticky fibers, taking a \u201315-foot penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute or until it Escapes (DC 34) or is cut free (AC 36, Hardness 8, 30 HP). If the target is adjacent to a wooden object of its size or larger, the target is instead immobilized and stuck to that object until it Escapes or is cut free."
            },
